<title>SOUTH AFRICA: DataTec makes 5.4 mln stg UK acquisition.</title>
<headline>DataTec makes 5.4 mln stg UK acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African electronics firm DataTec Ltd said on Tuesday it had bought a 78.5 percent stake in UK-based DataGuardian Ltd from Tech Holdings International Ltd in a deal worth 5.39 million stg.</p>
<p>DataGuardian, operating mainly in the south of England, is a distributor of communications and networking products. The acquisition is effective retrospectively from November 1, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
